**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest-tmp
**/test-tmp-*
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules

**/tests
**/*.db
**/*.md
**/*.pdf

